        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 28-E3, Clear Glass Egg Knob with Beveled Scalloped Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Glass Egg Knob with Arched Rose is a statement piece. The clear glass egg knob paired with the traditional arched rose will add an air of romance to any space. There is something so beautiful about the way light reflects in glass knobs. Fusion Hardware is known for their high quality products; and the fancy glass knobset is no exception. It is built to stand the test of time. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Available in 4 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 28-E3 Fancy Glass Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Traditional Clear Glass Egg Knob with Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Glass Egg Knob with Arched Rose, Fusion 28-E3",
                "description": "Fusion 28-E3 Glass Egg Knob with Arched Rose -- The Glass Egg Knob with Arched Rose is a statement piece. The clear glass egg knob paired with the traditional arched rose will add an air of romance to any space. There is something so beautiful about the way light reflects in glass knobs. Fusion Hardware is known for their high quality products; and the fancy glass knobset is no exception. It is built to stand the test of time. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Available in 4 finishes.\r\n",
